 "Library claims are version-pinned, harness-verified, and reliance is adapter-seamed pending evidence.",
 "Optimization begins with measurement instrumentation, observation windows, and evidence-driven decisions.",
 "Orphaned code passes through archaeology and characterization tests before any change lands.",
